      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Integration by parts gives \\( \\frac{s \\sin{\\left(4 s \\right)}}{4} - \\int \\frac{\\sin{\\left(4 s \\right)}}{4}\\,ds \\).",
         "point_type_id": "BC-PT-99057",
         "rule_named": "integration by parts"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "So the integral is \\( \\left[\\frac{s \\sin{\\left(4 s \\right)}}{4} + \\frac{\\cos{\\left(4 s \\right)}}{16}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{12}} = - \\frac{1}{32} + \\frac{\\sqrt{3} \\pi}{96} \\).",
